/**
 * steer — turn an intent brief into a steering document.
 *
 * Pipeline: research (repo recon → evidence) → seams (proposal, HUMAN GATE
 * via blocker) → draft (held-open session; deterministic lint via `check`)
 * → fact-audit + cold-read (fresh contexts, verdict-bearing) → bounded
 * revision loop back into the SAME draft session → one fix-only round plus a
 * terminal audit if blocking findings survived the cap → dossier.
 *
 * The design bets (see /tmp scratch design + cpiv synthesis):
 * - fresh context is a testing instrument: the cold reader sees Zone A only;
 * - revision feedback re-enters the drafter's live session (openNode), never
 *   a cold new agent — each round is its own graph node (`draft·r1`, …), so
 *   the graph shows what looped, carrying whose findings;
